{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a small slime on an epic journey through the Tower of Slimes. Immerse yourself in a world filled with diverse slimes and unique environments. With no prior knowledge, let the tower's caretaker guide you as you discover who you are and why you were created. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e0392965afef5111b85da2788a2d8908.poster.avif?t=1756864992\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e0392965afef5111b85da2788a2d8908.webm?t=1756864992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e0392965afef5111b85da2788a2d8908.mp4?t=1756864992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a universe rich in interactions and stories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e976b73dd6c17a612bcda3cb5b7df0bf.avif?t=1756864992\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, learn new abilities: shoot fireballs, stick to walls, and master the powers of the elements scattered throughout the tower \u2014 fire, ice, earth, plant, lightning, and poison \u2014 each with its own unique characteristics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/edc43a6f9fc3e0431be70cf5c3fa323c.avif?t=1756864992\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries within the Tower of Slimes, a place transformed by its inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/f685103adc5f3e9d6ee11929614ceaa1.avif?t=1756864992\" data-has-big width=800 height=447 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique landscapes with specific mechanics for each map, find hidden locations, and engage in special interactions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/ddb615740d52ac5818e98bce79853d6c.avif?t=1756864992\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story with meaningful choices, conversing with NPCs of each element. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/392b4ca43582493a9485389e23df9cfe.avif?t=1756864992\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your adaptive abilities, face challenging bosses and various enemies. Survive battles, grow stronger, and unveil the secrets of this fascinating world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/96de0944f72cb45faba721ae8caff06c.avif?t=1756864992\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3143310?t=1756864992","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3143310?t=1756864992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/f2371d717f8a85a770b6ce64a6f5a45196772ed3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756864992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/f2371d717f8a85a770b6ce64a6f5a45196772ed3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756864992","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3146230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a small slime on an epic journey through the Tower of Slimes. Immerse yourself in a world filled with diverse slimes and unique environments. With no prior knowledge, let the tower's caretaker guide you as you discover who you are and why you were created. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e0392965afef5111b85da2788a2d8908.poster.avif?t=1756864992\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e0392965afef5111b85da2788a2d8908.webm?t=1756864992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e0392965afef5111b85da2788a2d8908.mp4?t=1756864992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a universe rich in interactions and stories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/e976b73dd6c17a612bcda3cb5b7df0bf.avif?t=1756864992\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, learn new abilities: shoot fireballs, stick to walls, and master the powers of the elements scattered throughout the tower \u2014 fire, ice, earth, plant, lightning, and poison \u2014 each with its own unique characteristics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/edc43a6f9fc3e0431be70cf5c3fa323c.avif?t=1756864992\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries within the Tower of Slimes, a place transformed by its inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/f685103adc5f3e9d6ee11929614ceaa1.avif?t=1756864992\" data-has-big width=800 height=447 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique landscapes with specific mechanics for each map, find hidden locations, and engage in special interactions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/ddb615740d52ac5818e98bce79853d6c.avif?t=1756864992\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story with meaningful choices, conversing with NPCs of each element. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143310/extras/392b4ca43582493a9485389e23df9cfe.avif?t=1756864992\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><